3085 0 obj
  << /ActualText (By continuing to work with the Netbounce\054 the Candidate offers the Netbounce\015\nunequivocal consent to contact the Candidate via mass mail and automated calls until the\015\nCandidate requests to opt\055out\056\015\n\nTHE PARTIES HEREBY THEREFORE AGREE AS FOLLOWS\072\015\n\n1\056    DEFINITIONS\072\015\n\n    1\0561\056 \034Administration Fee\035 means the Fees chargeable by the Netbounce for work to\015\n           be carried out by the Netbounce for the Candidate\031s profile\056\015\n\n    1\0562\056 \034Agreement\035 means the contract between Netbounce and the Candidate for the\015\n           provision of the Services incorporating this agreement\056\015\n\n    1\0563\056 \034Agent\057 Netbounce\035 means a company having its principal place of business at\015\n           2404\054 1007 N Orange St\056 4th Floor\054 Wilmington\054 DE\054 New Castle\054 US 19801\056\015\n           \050We \057 Merchant\051\015\n\n    1\0564\056 \034Candidate\035 means a person who is seeking work opportunity via Netbounce\031s\015\n           services \050you\051\056\015\n\n    1\0565\056 \034Employee\035 means a Candidate who has been offered a job by an Employer and has\015\n           accepted that job\056\015\n\n    1\0566\056 \034Employer\035 means any individual\054 firm\054 or corporate body \050which expression shall\054\015\n           where the context so admits\054 include its successors and assigns\051 which the Candidate\015\n           is seeking to work for\056\015\n\n    1\0567\056 \034Fees\035 means all Fees payable to the Netbounce for the services\015\n\n    1\0568\056 \034Salary\035 means the Candidate\047s gross base pay paid by his\057her Employer\056 Upon\015\n           accepting the employment\056\015\n\n    1\0569\056 \034Interview Guarantee\035 means Netbounce guarantees to provide the number of interviews \n           promised under the selected plan through its resume marketing and placement services\056\n\n2\056    PREVALENT TERMS\015\n\n    2\0561\056 The Candidate shall always be on time for interviews\054 and training workdays and\015\n           agrees to inform the Netbounce 24 hours in advance by email or telephone of any\015\n           cancellation\056\015\n\n    2\0562\056 When the Employer offers the Candidate a job\054 the Candidate agrees to immediately\015\n           notify Netbounce of any employment\055related data\056\n\n    2\0563\056 Immediately after any meeting or conversation between the Candidate and the\015\n           Employer\054the Candidate must notify the Netbounce of the outcome of that meeting\015\n           or conversation prior to any Engagement\056\015)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3086 0 R
