3090 0 obj
  << /ActualText (    2\0564\056 The candidate is obligated to accept any job offer secured through Netbounce\015\n           services that aligns with the standard USA IT market rate and is deemed suitable for\015\n           their professional profile\056 Failure to comply with this requirement will be considered\015\n           a breach of the agreement\056\015\n\n    2\0565\056 Netbounce is not liable to assist in any assessments\056 However\054 for final round\015\n           assessments\054 Netbounce will provide the contact information of a technical person\015\n            who can assist the candidate\056 The payment for this assistance will be made by the\015\n           candidate\054 and Netbounce will reimburse the amount at the time of the offer letter\056\015\n           Any calendar invite received by the candidate from a any company via Netbounce\015\n           will be considered as an official interview\056\015\n\n    2\0566\056 The Candidate agrees to use the designated Netbounce marketing email address\n            exclusively for all enrollment and placement\055related communications\056 The Candidate \n           shall not forward\054 transfer\054 or share any data or communication from the marketing \n           email to any personal email address\054 nor provide a personal email to recruiters or  \n           clients\056 Any violation of this provision shall be considered a breach of this Agreement  \n           and may result in appropriate action\056\n\015\n    2\0567\056 All initial interviews\054 including screening rounds\054 shall be deemed official interviews\n           under this Agreement\054 as next interview rounds are contingent upon the candidate\031s \n           performance in such initial interviews\056 Only interviews coordinated through \n           NetBounce Placement that are relevant to the candidate\031s professional profile and for\n           which the candidate is eligible to work under applicable U\056S\056 laws and visa regulations \n           shall be considered\056\n\n    2\0568\056 If a candidate progresses through multiple rounds of interviews with the same company\054\n           each round will be counted as a separate interview\054 as these opportunities  are a result\n           of the expert resume and  interview preparation services provided by Netbounce\056\n\n    2\0569\056 If the Candidate was successful in getting placement via the Netbounce but failed \n           to notify the Netbounce and continued earning\054 the Candidate agrees to pay the \n           Netbounce with the fees as stated in this agreement\056\n          \n    2\05610\056 If the candidate delays accepting a job offer\054 loses the offer due to counter\055 \n             negotiations\054 or by negotiations related to sponsorship terms\054 Netbounce will not be \n             held liable\056 While Netbounce may help upon the candidate\047s request\054 the \n             associated risks and consequences will remain the sole responsibility of the \n             candidate\056\n\n    2\05611\056 The Candidate agrees not to raise any false or unauthorized payment disputes\n             for services rendered under this Agreement\056 In the event of a dispute\054 refunds \050if any\051 \n             shall be issued strictly in accordance with the terms of this Agreement\054 including \n             eligibility for partial refunds\056 Netbounce reserves the full right to recover any \n             outstanding or disputed payments through legal means\056\015\n\n    2\05612\056 If the candidate receives an offer letter through personal applications \n             using the resume provided by Netbounce\054 the candidate agrees to adhere to the \n             payment terms as outlined in this agreement\056)
