3100 0 obj
  << /ActualText (4\056    CANDIDATE \031S LIABILITIES\072\015\n\n4\0561\056 The Candidate undertakes and agrees with the Netbounce\072\015\n\n      a\051 The candidate will have to make reasonable efforts to complete the goal of getting a job           \n          that they have set for themselves with the Netbounce\056\015\n \n      b\051 The candidate shall make instalments and slot payments as specified in this\015agreement\056 \n          Failure to do so will be considered a breach of the agreement\056\015\n  \n      c\051 If the candidate is on F1 Visa and get enroll with Netbounce prior to his\057her\015start of \n          Employment Authorization Document date \050EAD\051 his\057her marketing will start 1 week \n          prior to the start date of his\057her EAD\056\n                 \n      d\051 The candidate must sign the enrollment agreement\054 complete our final\015onboarding \n          documents after receiving the offer letter\054 and provide all\015necessary documentation to \n          Netbounce\056 The candidate is liable to pay\015the offer letter amount on the day of offer letter \n          or on the day they\015receive the Pre background check from the employer\054 in case where\n          the\015background check is received before the employer issues the offer letter\056\015\n\n      e\051 The candidate acknowledges that the outcome of interview assistance or any technical \n          assistance provided by Netbounce\054 including RUC\054 TQC\054 and\015Training\054 may vary\056 This \n          variability can be influenced by the availability of\015technical personnel and the candidate\047s \n          knowledge and capabilities\056 This\015acknowledgment will be considered during the refund \n          process\056\015\n     \n      f\051 The candidate will consider this agreement as the standard proof of\015committed service\056 \n          Any other commitments or promises made by the\015salesperson will not be considered\n          during the refund process\056 If any promise\015or commitment is made by the salesperson\054\n          the candidate must submit proof\015of such communication via email\056\015\n\n      g\051 If the candidate has received sufficient services and is unable to crack the\015interviews \n          despite receiving adequate assistance\054 and if the funds paid by the\015candidate are           \n          exhausted\054 Netbounce will cease further services\056 Upon\015request\054 Netbounce will provide           \n          invoices for the services rendered for the\015candidate\047s profile\056\015\n\n\n5\056    PAYMENT TERM\072\015\n\n\n    5\0561\056 Enrollment Plan type\072\015\n\015)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3101 0 R
     /Pg 1606 0 R
     /S /Span
