3105 0 obj
  << /ActualText (    5\0562\056 Final payment conditions\072  \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n\n    5\0563\056 Current agreed payment condition\072\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n6\056    REFUND POLICY\072\n\n    6\0561\056 As per this agreement\054 please note that we do not offer refunds\052\054 and all sales are\015\n           considered final\056 The candidate needs to understand and acknowledge that refunds\015\n           are only applicable if the candidate chooses to enroll in our Interview Guarantee Plan\054\015\n           which is subject to specific refund conditions outlined below\056\015\n\n    6\0562\056 Additionally\054 the candidate should be aware that this document will serve as\015 evidence\n           of services provided in case of a dispute\054 thereby preventing any attempts to dispute\015\n           the transaction\056 Any payments made by the candidate through a relative\047s\054 friends\054 \n           or any other\015associated person\047s credit card are not subject to getting the money back \n           from disputes or chargebacks\056\015\015\n           \n    6\0563\056 The candidate agrees to promptly communicate any dissatisfaction or concerns \n           regarding these services during the course of the program\054 allowing Netbounce a\n           reasonable opportunity to address and improve the same\054 including arranging \n           additional sessions if required\056 Failure to raise such concerns during the service period\n           will be considered as acceptance of the services provided\054 and such claims will not be\n           considered at the time of refund evaluation\056\n\n    6\0564\056 Refund requests may be denied if there is third\055party involvement\050relative\057friend\051 on\015\n           behalf of the candidate\056\015\n\n    6\0565\056 If the candidate independently secures a job after one month from the Date of\015\n           Enrollment \050DOE\051\054 no refund is applicable as per the terms\056\015\n\n       Refund Terms and Conditions\072\015\n\n    6\0566\056 Eligibility for Refund\072 To be eligible for a refund\054 the candidate must have formally\015\n           enrolled in the Interview Guarantee Plan provided by Netbounce\056 Netbounce is not\015\n           obligated to issue any refund if the candidate fails to meet their responsibilities as\015\n           specified in the agreement\056\015\n\n)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3106 0 R
     /Pg 1992 0 R
