3110 0 obj
  << /ActualText (    6\0567\056 Refund Percentage\072If Netbounce secures 0 to 5 interviews\054 the Candidate shall\n           be eligible for an 80\045 refund\073 if 5 to 10 interviews\054 then 70\045 refund\073 and 11 to \n           15 interviews\054 then a 50\045 refund\054 with all refunds subject to deduction of\n           expenses incurred on the Candidate\031s profile as mentioned in below clause\056\n\n    6\0568\056 Expense\072 A monthly charge of \044375 will be deducted from any applicable refund \n           for the duration of services provided\056 This fee covers costs incurred by \n           Netbounce\054 including recruiter salaries for working on the Candidate\031s profile\054\n           payments to vendors for RUC sessions and interview assistance \050if taken\051\054 \n           marketing email expenses\054 and other related profile service costs\n\n    6\0569\056 Request for Refund\072 Candidate who meet the refund criteria must formally\015\n           request a refund by submitting a written request to Netbounce on\015\n           \042support\100foryounetbounceplacement\056raiseaticket\056com\042\056\n\n    6\05610\056 Refund Processing Time\072 Upon a valid refund request\054 Netbounce will review the\015\n             request and verify the candidate\031s eligibility\056 Once eligibility is confirmed\054the refund\015\n             will be processed within 30 days\056\015\n\n    6\05611\056 Cancellation of Enrollment\072 It\047s important to note that if a candidate chooses\015\n             to cancel their enrollment in the Interview Guarantee Plan during its term\054 no refund will\015\n             be initiated\054 and the candidate will not be eligible for a refund under these terms\n             and conditions\056\015\n\n7\056    SERVICE TERMINATION \046 EXIT POLICY\072\015\n\n    7\0561\056 If the candidate neglects Netbounce Placement services for 15 days or more without\015\n           prior notification\054 the Exit Policy becomes applicable\054 and Netbounce reserves the right\015\n           to terminate services for that candidate\056\015\n\n    7\0562\056 Netbounce reserves the right to terminate services without refund if\072\015\n            a\051 The Candidate fails to clear 20\053 screening\057interview calls arranged by the Netbounce\056\015\n            b\051 The Candidate is not meeting ideal profile criteria in reference to no relocation\054 high\015\n            salary demand\054 specific time frame job\054 guaranteed sponsorship job and more\056\015\n\n8\056    SUPPLEMENTARY SERVICES\072\015\n\n       If the Candidate is laid off by the Employer within 6 months and owes the Netbounce the\015\n       amount due as a condition\054 the Netbounce undertakes to provide a special service of\015\n       free re\055marketing of their profile for one month\056 After one month\054 the Candidate will be\015\n       responsible for an additional fee to continue remarketing services\056 If the Candidate\015\n       receives an alternate job through Netbounce\047s services within this one\055month period\054 the\015\n       re\055marketing Charges will be waived\056 Instead\054 the Candidate only has a responsibility to\015\n       reimburse the amount that they failed to repay to Netbounce in their First Job\056\015\n       Furthermore\054 the proportion count is based on high\055paying work\056\015\n\n       The reason for the layoff shall be genuine\056 Netbounce will not be liable if the candidate\015\n       is laid off due to poor work performance or personal reasons\056 Proof of terminations with\015\n       genuine reasons will be considered valid only if supported by email or in accurate\015\n       documentation\056\015\n\n)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3111 0 R
     /Pg 2448 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
