  << /ActualText (9\056    AMENDMENT\072\015\n\n       This Agreement may only be amended in writing and signed by duly authorized\015\n       representatives of the Parties\056\015\n\n10\056  ASSIGNMENT\072\n\n       Subject to the following\054 neither Party may assign\054 delegate\054 subcontract\054 mortgage\054\015\n       charge or otherwise transfer any or all of its rights and obligations under this \n       Agreement\015\n       without the prior written consent of the other Party\056\015\n\n11\056  ENTIRE AGREEMENT\072\015\n\n       This Agreement contains the whole Agreement between the parties and supersedes                        \n       and replaces any prior written or oral Agreements\054 representations or understandings   \n       between t hem\056 The parties confirm that they have not entered into this Agreement  \n       based on any  representation that is not expressly incorporated into this Agreement\056  \n       Nothing in this   Agreement excludes liability for fraud\056\n\n       In the event the candidate breaches the agreement\054 Netbounce reserves the legal right        \n       to take appropriate legal action through its affiliated law firms in the USA\056  \n       Netbouncemay serve a legal notice to the candidate\047s previous addresses and has the  \n       right to pursue legal action in the candidate\047s home country as well\056\n\n12\056  WAIVER\072\015\n\n       No failure or delay by the Netbounce in exercising any right\054 power\054 or privilege under         \n       this Agreement shall impair the same or operate as a waiver of the same nor shall any  \n       single or partial exercise of any right\054 power\054 or privilege preclude any further exercise   \n       of the same or the exercise of any other right\054 power or privilege\056 The candidate  \n       acknowledges that external factors\054 such as fluctuations in the market\054 may influence  \n       outcomes\054 and this should be considered\056 The rights and remedies provided in this  \n       Agreement are cumulative and not exclusive of any rights and remedies provided by        \n       law\056\n\n13\056  LAW AND JURISDICTION\072\015\n\n       The validity\054 construction\054 and performance of this Agreement shall be governed by US        \n       law and shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the US courts to which the       \n       Parties submit\056\n\n       By accepting this Agreement\054 the Candidate acknowledges that they have read and  \n       understood the terms related to payment terms\054 policies reimburse of payment and        \n       their procedure\054 etc\056 The Candidate further agrees that this clause is binding and       \n       enforceable\056)
