3130 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Job Acquire Program by Netbounce Placement LLC \023 Terms of Enrollment\015\n\050Hereinafter referred to as \034Agreement\035\051\015\n\015\n\nMade as of \050the \034Effective Date\035\051\015\n\015\n\n\nBetween\015\n\nNetbounce Placement LLC\054 a company having its principal place of business at 2404\054 1007 N\015\nOrange St\056 4th Floor\054 Wilmington\054 DE\054 New Castle\054 US 19801\056 It is duly incorporated under\015\nthe laws of the United States\056 \050Hereinafter referred to as \034Netbounce\035\051\015\n\nAnd\015\n\015\n\n\nName\072\015\n\015\n\nAddress\072\015\n\015\n\n\nContact\072\015\n\n\n \050Hereinafter referred to as \034Candidate\035\051\015\n\n\n\050Netbounce Placement LLC and Candidate are collectively referred to as \034Parties\035\051\015\n\015\n\n\nNetbounce Placement stands out as a premier job\055seeking service\054 distinguished by our\015\nextensive nationwide searches within the United States\056 Our mission is to identify the most\015\nsuitable candidates for a wide range of job roles\056 Leveraging our in\055depth experience in U\056S\056\015\nimmigration law\054 we extend our reach beyond national borders to place qualified individuals\015\nwith F1\054 H1B\054 H4\054 GC\054 and USC visas\056 What truly sets NetBounce apart is our pioneering\015\ncombination of job search and interview services\054 enabling us to adeptly fulfil even the most\015\nchallenging staffing needs\056\015\n\015\n\nRECITALS\015\n\nThe Candidate desires for the Netbounce to find them a job and\054 by registering\054\015\nunconditionally agrees that the Netbounce may use and disclose some of the information\015\nprovided to the Netbounce by the Candidate at its discretion to secure the Candidate a\015\nmoney\055earning opportunity\054 all subject to the provisions of this Agreement\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3129 0 R
     /Pg 3084 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

